{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就这样，在安洁的指示下，同学们开始帮忙制作蛋糕。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每个人做好自己负责的部分，分工合作得很顺利。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁！今天要用的材料已经搬完了。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“了解，那么装饰物制作小组的各位，可以开始动手啰！”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2643", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我这边就继续确认财务支出。”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar4122", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“遵命，麻烦你了！这个部份也很重要呢！”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2644", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么装饰物制作小组的各位，请看～请把刚送达的可可亚撒在手上，然后做出形状吧～这样那样这样那样！”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 49, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2645", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好快！而且好厉害！安洁那种技术模仿不来啊～”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 412, "voice": "ja0072", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，毕竟要当范本，必须拿出高水准的东西才行呢。”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2646", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好～如果有问题可以随时问安洁喔～”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2647", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“塑形巧克力里好像有塑胶。”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 400, "voice": "sk1024", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有那个问题喔！？就像昨天给各位看的那样，里面只有麦芽糖跟蔗糖而已喔！”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2648", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过……”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着装饰物制作小组的模样，我擦了擦汗喃喃自语。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁是个女仆，基本上不管是谁说的话她都会回“遵命”并且听从……", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过像这样照看旁人、指导旁人，似乎也非常适合她呢。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～感觉好像发现了喜欢的人新的一面……”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……啊，不好意思。安洁要暂时离开一会喔！”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2649", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“主人。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2650", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此时，安洁暂停了指导，朝我这边跑过来。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“您的头发乱了喔。汗水要再擦干一点才行。”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2651", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在百忙之中，安洁也没有忘记她是我的女仆。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她取出手帕，一边用手梳理我的头发，一边擦拭我额头上的汗水。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了，欸嘿嘿，这样又是平常那个优秀的主人了！”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2652", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈哈……谢谢你。抱歉喔，占用了你的时间。”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是安洁想为您做的……”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2653", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁希望主人一直都是这么优秀。因为不管怎么样，您都是安洁最喜欢的主人！”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2654", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好亲热喔……唉唉～”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 414, "voice": "jc0063", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“暂时丢下我们去找主人啊……”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "sa0043", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是好好喔，好像新婚夫妻。安洁也很快乐的样子。”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 412, "voice": "ja0073", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……抱歉，拖得太久了呢。真的很谢谢你，安洁。”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到幸福洋溢的安洁，有的人忌妒，也有的人羡慕。", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之我已经没问题了，我示意安洁回去原本在做的事。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，安洁也谢谢您。”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2655", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔喔喔，失礼了！那么就继续工作吧～”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2656", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“其他小组的各位如果有什么问题，请立刻跟安洁说喔～”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2657", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么什么，已经不用管主人了吗？”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 412, "voice": "ja0074", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀啊，请不要调侃安洁啦～安洁好羞耻喔～”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2658", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“与其说调侃，是安洁自己破绽太多了没办法。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 400, "voice": "sk1025", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“的确没办法呢。快点继续认真工作吧！”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2659", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，想一本正经地敷衍过去吗？”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "sa0044", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要再争论了，快点快点──”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2660", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果大家嬉闹了一阵子，又重新开始工作。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然有很多值得吐槽的地方，不过“因为是安洁”所以大家也就接受了。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我要做什么呢？”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ht0384", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“协助工作好像还要再一会才开始……”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛，到安洁下指示之前休息吧。我去准备饮料给大家。”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我也去～”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ht0385", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你很讨厌闲着呢，隼太。”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像不是只有我喔。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ht0386", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以这么说。”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉喔，因为料理的时候小熊喵不能进去，所以我也没办法帮忙。”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "mu0435", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会不会，反而要谢谢你陪我们来买东西。”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜……”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "pn0123", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“熊喵也谢谢喔。蛋糕做好后你也吃吧！”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜！！”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": "pn0124", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂混张家伙，我也要帮忙。”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "sn0389", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔，真的？”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ht0387", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要误会了！我是要代替温柔的美羽学姐帮忙！”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "sn0390", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐～我会连美羽学姐的份也一起帮忙混帐瓜生和安洁的～”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "sn0391", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哇啊，谢谢你小纱凪！”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "mu0436", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小纱凪好温柔喔，乖孩子乖孩子～”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "mu0437", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊无上幸福的瞬间……就是想要这个～”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "sn0392", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了，安洁被新吾摸头的时候也是这种感觉呢。”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ht0388", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁也只对她昵称‘小纱同学’，这两个人或许是很相像又要好的关系吧。”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好！走吧混帐家伙们！我来帮忙了，等着吧安洁～”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "sn0393", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，就麻烦你照这样子做喔。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2661", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这里要像这样做。戳一下戳一下……好了完成了！”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2662", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "sn0394", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没有帮忙的余地吧？”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "sn0395", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，没有那种事啦……”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我明白乾同学会这么说的心情。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "裙子和围裙随着她到处移动而翻飞，安洁手脚俐落地进行着工作。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "随着制作蛋糕的工作步上轨道，越是忙碌就越感觉到她的压倒性的存在感──", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看得着迷了。", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐纱凪同学，仔细一看，感觉女仆装好可爱喔……”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "结女学生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "jb0034", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯啊？怎么突然说这个。”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "sn0396", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有啊，你看，安洁转身的时候裙摆摇摇的样子好可爱……”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "结女学生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "jb0035", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像是这样喔主人。”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ht0389", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我懂那感觉。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且因为穿的人是安洁，感觉又更可爱了。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为那么可爱的女孩，做起事情来又能干又俐落。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“眼睛的地方用白巧克力做吧。像这样戳一下戳一下……”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2663", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哇、哇、好厉害……虽然刚才也看到了，不过这也太漂亮了吧～”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 412, "voice": "ja0075", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀～安洁真的好厉害！为什么你会那么多事情呢？”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 412, "voice": "ja0076", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，因为安洁是女仆喔！”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2664", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前就经常听到她说这句话，不过现在听起来却有了不同的感受。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "制作蛋糕的计划，成为了让我重新认识“现在的安洁”的一个契机。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯，各项准备工作都进行得比预想中还要顺利呢……”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2665", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们一直工作到日落，巧克力装饰这部分累积了相当多的进度。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“话虽如此，无论怎么努力，前一天晚上还是得在学校过夜才行吧？”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，这也没办法。到时恐怕烤炉必须全日运转，安洁也要专心一直挤生奶油呢。”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2666", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过多亏了装饰物的准备很顺利，负担轻松了不少。”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2667", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且当天要使用的材料也订购好了……”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2668", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "关上冰箱，安洁转身面对大家。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，各位今天辛苦了！”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2669", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明天一天请好好休息，星期日到休业式当天，终于要制作蛋糕本体啰♪”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2670", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "同学们喔喔喔地兴奋了起来。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要工作进展得顺利，就算疲惫也还是很开心呢。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还有明天可以休息这个意外惊喜，加深了喜悦的感觉。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么那么，大家可以借给安洁一点时间吗？”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2671", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，还有什么事吗？”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar4123", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“善后整理也已经结束了。”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 400, "voice": "sk1026", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是的不是的，安洁正准备要泡茶，请各位润润喉之后再回去吧♪”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 391, "voice": "ag2672", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很体贴欸喂～”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ht0390", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在一天的最后，我的安洁依然没有忘记要表达对大家的感谢之意。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
